    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yapori Minigames is a multiplayer game with mini-games and several playable characters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various different and challenging mini-games, such as the meteor mini-game where you have to dodge meteors until time runs out, a soccer mini-game where you have to score a specific number of goals before time runs out to win, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to earn more skins! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 skins to unlock, such as Darkpori, a fox with a gray scarf and blue shoes, Aybo, an intelligent and somewhat annoying robot, Jack, a crazy yellow monkey, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Mode where you can play Minigames with up to 6 Players! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yapori Minigames is a multiplayer game with mini-games and several playable characters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various different and challenging mini-games, such as the meteor mini-game where you have to dodge meteors until time runs out, a soccer mini-game where you have to score a specific number of goals before time runs out to win, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to earn more skins! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 skins to unlock, such as Darkpori, a fox with a gray scarf and blue shoes, Aybo, an intelligent and somewhat annoying robot, Jack, a crazy yellow monkey, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Mode where you can play Minigames with up to 6 Players! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>",
